{"type":"text","timestamp":1794582978441,"sessionID":"ses_e2a8827b9ffejVRAHZ3ApYn2Go","part":{"id":"prt_1d57b0c2e002ZJI3uI3oyXPDNU","sessionID":"ses_e2a8827b9ffejVRAHZ3ApYn2Go","messageID":"msg_1d57af42a001fkNvQj2rWYNyc2","type":"text","text":"T004 is done. Report follows.\n\n## Files written\n\n1. `.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/sync-runtime-mirrors.test.mjs`\n   - Renamed `counts what each runtime shows and allows the known create collapse` → `counts what each runtime shows and flags the create collapse`; it now expects `['COLLAPSE create/skill.md hides 1 sibling commands on Claude Code']`.\n   - Added `flags a skill file in any capitalisation` with `.claude/commands/design/SKILL.md` + `design/chart.md`, expecting Claude `{ visible: 1, total: 2 }` and `['COLLAPSE design/SKILL.md hides 1 sibling commands on Claude Code']`.\n\n2. `.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/runtime-mirrors/sync-runtime-mirrors.cjs`\n   - Deleted `COLLAPSE_ALLOWLIST`, its comment and the `collapseDrift` line reading it; replaced the block with the comment naming the open upstream bug (anthropics/claude-code#85786) and the rule that no command file may carry that name.\n   - `commandVisibility` and `collapseDrift` now compare `name.toLowerCase() === 'skill.md'`; the drift message names the file as spelled (`design/SKILL.md`).\n   - Both doc comments now say \"in any capitalisation\".\n\n3. `.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/runtime-mirrors/README.md`\n   - Replaced the section 5 sentence with the \"any command folder … in any capitalisation\" wording.\n\n## Verify output\n\n```\n$ node --check $MS\nexit=0\n$ NMST\nℹ tests 9\nℹ pass 9\nℹ fail 0\n$ rg -c COLLAPSE_ALLOWLIST $MS\nexit=1 (1 = no match, prints nothing)\n$ node -p \"(m => JSON.stringify(m.commandVisibility(m.buildExpectedLinks()).claude))(require(...))\"\n{\"visible\":44,\"total\":44}\n$ rg -c 'other than .create/.' $MSR\nexit=1 (1 = no match, prints nothing)\n```\n\nTest-first gate was observed before the fix: `fail 2` (`pass 7`, `tests 9`), failing only the renamed create case and the new capitalisation case. `before.txt` records `pass 8`, so 9 is the required one-more pass. `SRM` was not run, per the task's instruction.\n\n## Not done / notes\n\n- `tasks.md` checkbox for T004 was left unticked, as instructed.\n- No git state touched; no commits, pushes or restores. `git status --short` over the three paths shows only those three modified files.\n- Nothing else was blocked.","time":{"start":1794582973486,"end":1794582978441}}}
